ria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","review_id":"VlJ-EgnSTsj2G7l-afZPaQ","date":"2014-10-31T20:28:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9393274784088135,"text_excerpt":"I loved this place. One of my co-workers who loves NOLA like we do put this spot on my radar & boy am I glad she did. The guy who greeted us at the door, ended up being our server. He turned out to be extremely friendly, engaging and helpful, with that beautiful \"YAT\" accent that I love :) We snagged a great window seat for great people watching. Our server made a couple of drink suggestions that were really good. The Second Line Lemonade & I think the other drink was called the Jazz Funeral ? Anyway, both were good, but the star for me was those dang Seafood Nachos ! OMG they were so good. My hubby enjoyed his Chicken Burger but did not care for the Potato Salad. I tasted it too & it was..."},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","review_id":"vwIWVnv6QajdDJ5IrxDilw","date":"2017-07-28T20:28:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354303479194641,"text_excerpt":"This is the only place in NOLA that we came to twice. The bartender was super sweet and friendly (we got her twice fortunately!) and the seafood nachos... wow. Those are a must try. Overall just a great atmosphere with a friendly staff and delicious food!"},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","review_id":"jeVaC6XjOvBzA9PLs6S81g","date":"2015-08-16T21:58:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.933691680431366,"text_excerpt":"Great food! We came one afternoon and got the seafood nachos and shrimp and grits. Both were very tasty! It's definitely more of a bar scene as it is right in the French Quarter. The staff was very helpful and went above and beyond so that was a nice touch."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","photo_id":"6_2OwTE_2ezVgC4iBswzWQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/6_2OwTE_2ezVgC4iBswzWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9138668179512024},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","photo_id":"U4QRPt-CTxTic_MRwYSjww","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/U4QRPt-CTxTic_MRwYSjww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.868587851524353},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","photo_id":"hDothcutNnse3pkxi1KSVA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hDothcutNnse3pkxi1KSVA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8644438982009888},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","photo_id":"Z8vqrk_Ul2Wnj_wheCN_fA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z8vqrk_Ul2Wnj_wheCN_fA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8121426105499268},{"business_id":"nihvarTktbLi1CI_Dkep4Q","photo_id":"fpsCP3lEQ3C6ySQMFqM4Jw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fpsCP3lEQ3C6ySQMFqM4Jw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7925713658332825}]},"notebook_case":null}
